{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22307","headline":"赠言 · 白居易","name":"赠言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"捧籯献千金，彼金何足道。\n临觞赠一言，此言真可宝。\n流光我已晚，适意君不早。\n况君春风面，柔促如芳草。\n二十方长成，三十向衰老。\n镜中桃李色，不得十年好。\n胡爲坐脉脉，不肯倾怀抱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}